ers are cheetah  king shark  captain boomerang count vertigo and  enchantress  these are the more sort of side  characters that you won't spend too much  time with  but they're all pretty balanced with  king shark being a hulk-like character  and cheetah being a fast-moving stealthy  combatant meanwhile the justice league  roster is made up of batman  superman wonder woman flash green latin  martian manhunter shazam and hawk girl  this is a really interesting lineup  and i can't wait to see how batman  returns after his dramatic departure at  the end of arkham knight  now there was a post on reddit before  the game was announced from a user that  said that they'd played parts of it  this was deleted quite quickly but  website nerd stash managed to get the  info from it  again take this with a pinch of salt but  as it appeared before the official  announcement  it does add some weight to it the  leakers said that they'd managed to play  against two of the bosses  and that these were wonder woman and  batman they said that batman pretty much  plays exactly like how he did in the  arkham games  predominantly using gadgets and stealth  attacks the users stated that there was  even a predator section  similar to the arkham series however the  game developers had switched things up a  bit  and you were actually the prey this time  with batman hunting you  so big big boss battle that i definitely  think will take a lot of boxes for fans  when discussing wonder woman they said  that she uses her lasso a lot to try and  grab you  and then pulls you in with a sword she's  also able to block a lot of the standard  attacks with a shield  so you have to combo her in order to  break her defenses  and take it down they didn't give much  info on the gameplay beyond that  but it does sound really really  enthralling according to the leaker the  story centers on amanda walla and lex  luther  attempting to create doomsday through  project cadmus in order to eliminate  the justice league wallah plans to  capture the league by sending the squad  in to bring them back alive  in order to await their doom stay  in order to await their doomsday maybe  maybe she should team up with mr freeze  with them puns probably won't happen  though because i heard he's given her  the cold shoulder  we've still got the best ones anyway  that's all of the leaks on the game that  we have so far  and before we jump into gotham knights i  just want to let you know we're giving  away  a free copy of the avengers on any  console of your choice  and all you have to do to begin with the  chance of winning is like the video  subscribe to the channel and drop a  comment below on your thoughts  the win is going to be chosen at random  on the 30th of august so make sure you  get involved  i don't know it's not exactly a batman  game but hey you might enjoy it  and if not you can always use it as a  frisbee or as  captain america shield and enjoy it  however you want  now as for gotham night we have some big  announcements on it  so yesterday wb montreal dropped a  cryptic tweet  that had a video in which seemingly  nothing happened it was basically  a circle and a line moving about a  circular grid  however there was a split-second image  that appeared in it  which showed the symbol of an owl this  of course teases the court of owls  who according to the leaks are the big  bad of the game  now in case you don't know the court  were first created by scott snyder  and they were teased in his books before  making their debut in the new 52  snyder dropped little owl statues on  certain pages in the run-up to their  reveal  and this subliminally hinted to the  reader that they were throughout the  city  owls are of course a natural predator of  bats and in the run  we learned that the court of owls had  been lurking in the shadows of gotham  controlling major events since its  creation the court were made up of  high-ranking members of the city  and through their power they'd  controlled elections social events  and all of the politics within gotham  through their assassins the talons  they'd shaped gotham in their image and  batman had to bring them down in order  to stop the city from spiraling into  further darkness  they're excellent enemies for him to  face off against in my opinion  are probably snyder's greatest creation  now the tweet itself pointed to a  twitter account  that had a website link in it upon  clicking this you were  taken to a website which had the text we  have been expecting you  and today's date we didn't want to wait  to see what the announcement was though  and shout outs to bat source for  figuring out that if you change your  computer calendar  then a new message appears which  welcomes you back this is four inputs on  it  and jordan oliman on twitter figured out  that there was going to be a small  teaser every day  leading up to the 21st which is this  friday i know that people call you  jordan  but from now on i'm calling you hackaman  now this could potentially mean that we  get a teaser the day before fandom  which hints at what's going to be in the  game before the big panel  the user also managed to get a  screenshot upon entering the code 761  and this spat out the image of a  wireframe city with a marking on it  we have no idea what this means yet but  it does look like detective vision  and an objective hopefully over the next  couple of days we'll be getting more  information  i'll definitely keep you peeled if  anything pops up now according to the  leaks on this story  we will actually be playing as the  entire bat family this time throughout  the game  similar to the suicide squad entry we'll  get a number of playable characters that  will help to flesh out the story  in case you don't know gotham knight is  actually the title of a comic book run  send it around the bat family and thus  it makes sense for this game to tie into  it too  anyway like i said i'll try and keep you  posted on the updates 